    "notes": "Cantonese is typed via Jyutping romanization plus candidate selection. This is a standard Latin QWERTY base emitting lowercase Jyutping letters; composition=true. Hanzi output requires a Jyutping to candidate IME that is NOT implemented by the app, so the keyboard emits Latin Jyutping letters only. QWERTY arrangement is standard and reviewed."
